  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Coalition - transforming agrifood systems to become more resilient to shocks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the project aims at contributing to the transformation of agrifood systems and to meeting the SDGs by 2030 through creating an enabling environment in the short run, analysing the ways to reduce the impact of global crises on agrifood systems, with the long-term objective of transforming them to become more resilient to shocks, and with climate-smart and nutrition-sensitive approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
